  "name": "blst",
  "description": "A high-performance BLS12-381 signature library written in C and assembly, specifically engineered for side-channel resistance and formal verification. It implements IETF BLS Signature V5 and RFC 9380 standards, utilizing highly optimized assembly kernels for x86_64 and ARM64 to perform field and elliptic curve operations. The library maintains run-time neutrality by eschewing internal memory management and multi-threading, facilitating seamless integration into secure execution environments.",
